### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Compare the oldest queued workflow item with controller logs and active reconciliation. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
A blocked reconciliation, insufficient controller capacity or an unavailable dependency.

### Fix
Resolve the blocking dependency and confirm new workflow items progress.

### Verify
The oldest queue item age falls below the threshold and pending workflows advance. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
